onal bosses add excitement to the challenge. The game's focus is on creating item combinations with a relaxed and chilled experience. With strategic builds, the right upgrades, and patience, you'll find yourself ready for increasingly challenging challenges as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029300/extras/a4b9bfdc0498921a0c7bf04f2cb7957c.poster.avif?t=1764027821\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029300/extras/a4b9bfdc0498921a0c7bf04f2cb7957c.webm?t=1764027821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029300/extras/a4b9bfdc0498921a0c7bf04f2cb7957c.mp4?t=1764027821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Idle's gameplay mechanics, progress continues even when you're not in the game. When you log back in, you'll encounter new items, power-ups, and surprises to discover. Loot of Idle appeals to both those seeking a relaxed pixel atmosphere and those seeking the pleasure of in-depth development and item stacking.</p>","developers":["DarkRook Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029300/10522fbe47e9ba28180fe65b53f29a0a789e0b28/header.jpg?t=1764027821","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4029300/466349402/651075373906db9fc742faa7db3fc80f10b4fd24/1761351424/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761352280","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4029300/466349402/651075373906db9fc742faa7db3fc80f10b4fd24/1761351424/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761352280","highlight"